# The staged roots are mapped to pgg_smc AFTER production's, because Rocq
# 9.0.0 resolves a Require to the LAST matching -R or -Q entry.
# staged/manifest therefore supplies pgg_tableau_syntax and
# staged/instances/<i> supplies pgg_smc.tableau.<file>, while every other
# Require of a staged file falls through to production's .vo, which is what
# keeps pgg_tableau.v, the instance runs and the analysis models out of this
# probe.  Nothing is written into the production tree: each staged .vo lands
# beside its .v under staged/.
-R staged/manifest pgg_smc
-R staged/instances/pgl27 pgg_smc
-R staged/instances/s5 pgg_smc
-R staged/instances/kim2025 pgg_smc
-R staged/instances/psl211 pgg_smc

# The miniature of K4 gets a root of its own, disjoint from the staged
# ones, so that no directory is bound twice and the measurements are read
# without a remapping warning in the way.
-Q mini surface2_mini

